{
    "id":  3473,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "8W LED Bulbs Filament  E27 A60 - Dimmable",
    "reference":  "A60DIM8W-90919-22K-100",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003efilament\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e A60 has a power of \u003cstrong\u003e4W\u003c/strong\u003e and a cap type \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e. You can replace your conventional bulbs, incandescent and carbon easily, and thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e technology reduce your electricity consumption while maintaining a classic design.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe bulb is \u003cstrong\u003edimmable\u003c/strong\u003e by \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e8W LED Bulbs Filament  E27 A60 - Dimmable\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003eLED filament bulb \u003c/strong\u003ehas an \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e type cap and has \u003cstrong\u003e4W\u003c/strong\u003e power. It provides a warm atmosphere as its temperature is 2200K.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIt stands out for being Dimmable, so the \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e can \u003cstrong\u003eregulate\u003c/strong\u003e its \u003cstrong\u003elight\u003c/strong\u003e intensity between 0-100%, to be able to perform this function it is necessary to acquire a Regulator. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIt allows you to save on your energy consumption thanks to its LED technology, as well as maintenance and replacement costs. You will respect the environment without renouncing the classic design of conventional light bulbs. It also has a luminous efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003e100lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIt is a multipurpose bulb because you can use it both at home and in your workplace can create original environments with a retro touch without forgetting our guarantee of 2 years.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUses of 8W E27 A60 Filament LED Bulb - Dimmable\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDecorative lighting\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRestaurants\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHotels\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRoom\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesk or bedside lamps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLiving rooms\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eChillout\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical specifications of each \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
